4,Ministry of Culture-Austronesian Music and Cultural Exchange,https://www.moc.gov.tw/en/cp.aspx?n=443,"I noticed that there is no literature on the bamboo drums in the past, but I saw the bamboo drums formerly at the Tainan University of the Arts and took some photos of them. So I am very proud of it. The bamboo drums are very much like the ones in the North of the Philippines, and it is the evidence that Taiwan is the origin of the Austronesians. The other musical instrument is the Jew's harp.",Mandar,Austronesian
